From 17a17be410b9f7ba5662983d349f0f633efda598 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 11:25:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(inventory): preserve creative item user data

Read the full 2193 creative item descriptor, including fields after an empty group icon, and decode its user data with the same item codec used for normal stacks. This preserves firework flight NBT when a creative item is dragged into the inventory.
---
 .../protocol/packet/InventoryPackets.java     | 25 ++++++++---
 .../protocol/types/item/BedrockItemType.java  | 12 +++--
 .../protocol/packet/InventoryPacketsTest.java | 44 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 72 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/protocol/packet/InventoryPackets.java b/src/main/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/protocol/packet/InventoryPackets.java
index 810c04a6..18528e83 100644
